<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Main results on streaming reasoning benchmarks with Qwen3-1.7B/4B. We compare AdaSR-HRPO with GRPO, read-then-think, and SFT-based baselines, reporting accuracy and streaming/deep/total lengths. Percentages denote relative changes over StreamingThinker (SFT); red indicates improvements and green degradations.</figcaption>
