<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>Effect of hierarchical advantage assignment on GSM-symbolic P2/P1. We report accuracy and phase-specific lengths for GRPO, HRPO, sentence-level, and token-level variants. Percentages are relative to GRPO; red/green denote improvements/degradations. Token-level assignment only affects the format boundary token.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S4.F2" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.14694v1/Acc.svg" id="S4.F2.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/132;" width="476" height="132"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 2: </span>Training dynamics of GRPO and HRPO variants.
